Rule 13 (effective dimension size when indexing with a negative axis must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= if -1 * ndim(v_1) ≤ v_3 ∧ v_3 < 0 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) + v_3) > 0
