Rule 14 (index bounds when addressing a dimension via a negative axis)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= if -1 * ndim(v_1) ≤ v_3 ∧ v_3 < 0 then -1 * shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) + v_3) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 < shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) + v_3)
